## 4. SSE 事件协议（主通道）—— 前端统一消费格式

### 4.1 SSE headers
- Content-Type: text/event-stream
- Cache-Control: no-cache
- Connection: keep-alive

### 4.2 事件格式（统一）
SSE 每条消息：
event: <type>
id: <seq>
data: <json>

### 4.3 事件类型定义
1) job.started
data:
{
  "job_id":"j1",
  "session_id":"s1",
  "task":"generate_draft",
  "phase":"4",
  "ts": 173...
}

2) job.delta
data:
{
  "job_id":"j1",
  "seq": 12,
  "delta":"一段文本...\\n\\n",
  "ts": 173...
}

3) job.progress（可选）
data:
{
  "job_id":"j1",
  "seq": 13,
  "step":"drafting",
  "percent": 0.4,
  "ts": 173...
}

4) job.error
data:
{
  "job_id":"j1",
  "seq": 20,
  "retryable": true,
  "code": "LLM_TIMEOUT",
  "message": "...",
  "ts": 173...
}

5) job.completed
data:
{
  "job_id":"j1",
  "seq": 99,
  "is_final": true,
  "ts": 173...
}

6) session.state（可选，用于 phase/substate 更新）
data:
{
  "session_id":"s1",
  "phase":"4.5",
  "substate":"await_select",
  "pending_input":"revision_choice",
  "next_actions":[{"id":"act_revise","label":"继续修订","primary":true},{"id":"act_edit","label":"我来改","primary":false}],
  "ts": 173...
}

