## 9. 小程序：客户端流式消费（SSE 优先，Polling 兜底）

### 9.1 本地持久化 keys
- active_session_id
- active_job_id
- active_job_seq
- active_job_snapshot

### 9.2 统一消费接口（伪代码）
- connect(job_id):
  - GET /api/jobs/:jobId -> snapshot + seq
  - render(snapshot)
  - try open SSE /api/jobs/:jobId/stream with Last-Event-ID=seq
    - onmessage: applyEvent(e)
    - onerror: fallbackToPolling()
- polling(job_id, afterSeq):
  - GET /api/jobs/:jobId/poll?afterSeq=afterSeq
  - apply events; update seq
  - schedule next poll w/ backoff rules

applyEvent:
- delta: append to UI text；update snapshot/seq；persist
- progress: update badge
- error: show retry/save buttons
- completed: show commit/next step actions

