## 10. 发布控制台（可控性）
后端接口（增量加，不影响现有）
- POST /api/publish/dry-run
- POST /api/publish/execute

Dry-run response 必须包含 execution_plan：
{
  "ok": true,
  "risks":[{"level":"warn","message":"标题过长"}],
  "execution_plan":[
    {"step":"save_artifact","target":"publish_record"},
    {"step":"sync_feishu","target":"kb:xxx"},
    {"step":"create_wechat_draft","target":"mp:草稿箱"}
  ]
}

